Ep<S_E_0_____~~~~~What is new?
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Added current entry options to the filter button in the export dialog
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~In the entry list, when the current entry is not visible, highlight the first exposed parent of it in gray
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Removed the exemption for non-indented paragraphs when parenting plain paras to bullet paras
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Updated Brazilian Portuguese translation
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Bug fixes, mainly:
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Fixed some glitches in moving entries around the list
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Fixed keeping selection when a parent is expanded/collapsed
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Fixed crash on printing when an image is not found
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Fixed and a bit optimized saving filtered entries
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Prevent internal entry in the smart add dialog from being added to the diary
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Fixed clearing background images of themes
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Fixed loading theme icons that don't have a path
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Fixed some glitches in the table view scrollbar
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Fixed listing multiple matches in the same paragraph on search view
