EpD3.0.0 / Babies are being killed before the eyes of the world
EpD2024-12-29 
Ep<S_E_0_____~~~~~What is new?
EpDLifeograph 3.0 is a very huge update on top of the big changes introduced on Lifeograph 2.0. With this version, Lifeograph evolved form a diary/note taking application into a general purpose information management environment.
EfB191|213|
EpD
Ep<B_E_0_____~~~~~General
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~New main icon that reflects the improved functionality as a second brain
EfB0|13|
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~General UI changes to make the UI more compliant with the new trends
EfB0|18|
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Time values in HH:MM[:SS] format in entries are detected and stored to be processed in tables, etc.
EfB0|11|
EfI15|25|
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~UI upgraded to GTK4 replacing the deprecated UI elements with new ones
EfB15|19|
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Append the parents of an entry to its name in the tool tips and other relevant places
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~To speed up opening a diary, parse the entries asynchronously
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Entry dates are determined from the text now
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Replaced the Today button with the smart add button which provides more options for adding a new entry
EfB35|51|
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Added a go forward button to the headerbar
EfB8|18|
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~All file I/O is moved to Gio for compatibility with network addresses and virtual drives, etc.
EfB25|28|
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Several improvements in printing
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Any filter can be used while exporting the diary
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Added diary options and paragraph formats to the synchronization diff view
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Chapters are removed (Entries marked as milestone and filters together can provide the same functionality)
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Colors can now be assigned to entries now which is also used for boundaries of tags to those entries (this used to be possible only for chapters previously)
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Added an option to reformat all dates in the textual contents of all entries per the current  date separator
Ep<B_E_0_____~~~~~Text editor
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Wiki style formatting markup is largely omitted in favor of a WYSIWYG style formatting system [[inline comments are an exception]]
EfB62|75|
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Paragraph folding that creates folds automatically based on heading and indentation levels
EfB0|17|
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Widened & colored side margins to improve readability
EfB0|30|
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Moved the entry icon to the side margin for better contextual organization
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~New references button that pops up a list of referencing entries/paragraphs for the current entry (a.k.a back-links)
EfB105|115|
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Split paragraph options into a dedicated popover to prevent overcrowded menus
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Context-sensitive right-click menu that displays specific options for tags, images, dates, etc. based on the cursor location
EfB0|34|
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Tables can also be inserted into the entries now
EfB0|6|
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Improved dealing with inline tags
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~To-do paragraph icons are real icons now
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Underline is added to the formatting options
EfB0|9|
EfU0|9|
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Subscript and Superscript formatting options
EfC0|9|
EfP14|25|
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Roman numbers is added to the numeric list types
EfB0|13|
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Added buttons for visiting link items to the right-click popover menu
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Added horizontal rules which can also be combined with text
EfB6|22|
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Allow any type of paragraph to attain a list  type
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Added options for changing the letter casing to the context menu
EfB18|44|
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Drastically improved expand selection
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Added pixels above subheading lines for better visual differentiation
Ep<B_E_0_____~~~~~Entry list
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Entries can now be ordered, grouped, and arranged freely, irrespective of the their types
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Dynamic sorting is removed as the position of an entry in the list is now a major property of it (but a subset of entries can still be statically sorted via the dedicated menu items )
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Added an option to merge selected entries
Ep<B_E_0_____~~~~~Filtering
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Removed the filtering tab from the bottom panel. Filters are edited in the filter dialog now.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Added stock filters for some standard tasks such as <Trashed>
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Show the usage counts of filters
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Added many new filterers:
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Size
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Has Unit
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Descendant
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Tag Value
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Has Subtag
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Contains Text
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Has Coordinates
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Title Style
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Is Image
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Heading Level
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Equals
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Child Filter
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~All filters can be negated now
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~It is possible to directly edit a filter by right-clicking the filter chooser button
Ep<B_E_0_____~~~~~Tables
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Columns are resizable now
EfB12|21|
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~New column types added:
EfB0|16|
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Duration
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Date & Time (replaced Date)
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Gantt Chart (very basic)
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Arithmetic
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Size
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Todo Status
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Number
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~True/False
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Theme
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Group lines in a hierarchical view by any column
EfB0|11|
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Conditional coloring of cell values
EfB0|20|
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Completion columns show a progress bar in the background
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Option to combine identical consequent cells in a column to get cleaner tables  
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Option to show the parents of an entry in the name columns
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~The summary function to be used in the total line can be customized now
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Try to update the current table in real time when the current entry is being edited
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Count column replaced as the new group lines always show the count now
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Added a completion percentage option to the tag value columns
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Implemented a delta mode for the columns
EfB14|19|
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Conditional option converted into a "count if satisfies a selected filter" option
Ep<B_E_0_____~~~~~Charts
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Added a new vertical bars style
EfB12|31|
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Charts are now dependent upon tables which allows visualizing much more complex relationships
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~A basic inline table was added to allow creation of basic charts without creating a table first
Ep<B_E_0_____~~~~~Calendar
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Added navigation icons to the calendar widget
EfB6|22|
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Added the ability to mark custom days as holidays
EfB26|49|
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Added the ability to change the first day of the week
EfB32|53|
Ep<B_E_0_____~~~~~Searching
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Searching is multi-threaded now for speed gains and responsiveness
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Added an option to limit the search to those entries that satisfy a filter
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Search selected text within the diary
Ep<B_E_0_____~~~~~Map
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Migrated from libchamplain to libshumate which also works under Windows
EfB30|40|
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Location marks are tied to paragraphs now which allows adding notes, tags, etc to the locations
