EpD2.0.0 / processing data is a delicious experience
EpD2020.12.06 
Ep<S_E_0_____~~~~~What is new?
EpDEVERYTHING! —Lifeograph 2.0 is the culmination of months of hard work and constitutes the biggest improvement step so far in the history of the program. No part remained untouched; every aspect of the user experience received its share of boost.
EpD
EpDAlso, in this version many idiosyncrasies of the program replaced with more intuitive or widespread user interface paradigms.
EpD
EpDWatch a video about the main updates on YouTube
EfL0|47|https://youtu.be/ubVz2Tnl0bM
EpD
EpD
Ep<B_E_0_____~~~~~Everything is Entry!
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Numbered and free chapters, tags, and tag categories are removed and their functionality merged into entries. Chapters are also a special kind of entry now.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~This on one hand simplified the workflow but on the other hand also opened the door for new possibilities such as adding content to everything and creating links between them.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Numbered and free entries can now be organized in a hierarchical way in the list, up to 3 levels. e.g. entry 1.1 will be listed under 1.0 and 1.1.1 will be listed under 1.1.
EpD
Ep<B_E_0_____~~~~~Text editor
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~The entry text editor is ever-preset now. In the 1.X era, the central panel used to be used for displaying/editing many things in addition to entries. In 2.X paradigm, such functionality is done in the extra panel.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Remember last scroll positions in entries during a session.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~The internals of dealing with embedded images overhauled resulting in a better user experience.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Added an option to copy embedded images to a relative path to the diary file. This will help keeping all the data related to a diary in one folder.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Word count is now updated periodically (on a separate thread) while editing.
EpD
Ep<B_E_0_____~~~~~Toolbar
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~The functionality of the fixed toolbar and the right click menu unified in a popover that can be accessed by right clicking.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~This is part of the efforts for achieving a more distraction-free writing environment where tools are hidden unless they are needed.
EfT49|65|4687204
EpD
Ep<B_E_0_____~~~~~Entry list
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Now that everything is entry, entry list only lists entries, indeed. There is no item for the diary itself (the diary properties can be edited from the dedicated diary button in the headerbar.)
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~A right click menu added for easy access to some properties.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Changing properties of multiple entries can only be dome from the right-click menu.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Sorting direction for ordinal and temporal entries can now be set separately.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Entries can now be sorted by name as well.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Much improved the drag and drop system which now offers to drop before, after, and into an entry.
EpD
Ep<B_E_0_____~~~~~Tags are dead long live tags!
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~While the special entity called tag is no more, entries can now be used instead for achieving the same goal plus more.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~So entries can be tagged with entries but so can paragraphs.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Entries can be filtered per being tagged with an entry.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Graphs can be plotted per having a reference to a tag (entry) or per value they assign to a tag (entry).
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~The tag bar and the tag panel was removed. distraction-free
EfT43|59|4687204
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~There is an IDE-like auto completion popover for reliving the user from having to type entire entry names.
EfT12|20|6460427
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Inline tags also behave like links to other entries. This also provides another means for linking entries in addition to by date & by id.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Added a new syntax to specify planned value for a tag in the form of :TAG:=REALIZED/PLANNED
EfI69|91|
EpD
Ep<B_E_0_____~~~~~More paragraph oriented work-flow paragraph-focused
EfT34|51|3685621
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~This version gives more sovereignty to paragraphs elevating them to distinctly recognized elements in the database.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Paragraphs can now be justified to center and right.
EpD
Ep<B_E_0_____~~~~~Extra panel
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~A new panel added to the bottom of the window for various functionality, such as searching, filtering, charts, etc...
EpD
Ep<B_E_0_____~~~~~The new calendar widget
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Replaced the standard Gtk+ calendar with a custom made calendar widget that better integrates with the rest of the program and offers additional features.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Chapter background colors are now displayed in the calendar.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Added a right click menu for creating entries and chapters on selected dates.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Days can now be dragged & dropped into entry text.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~In the future more features will be added to the calendar.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Now it is also possible to select dates (instead of typing them) using the calendar popover activated from the calendar icon in date picker widgets.
EpD
Ep<B_E_0_____~~~~~The new table view
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~A new extra panel for displaying tabular data conveniently.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Tables are created through a very simple interface.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Tables can base on entry level as well as paragraph level data. paragraph-focused
EfT64|81|3685621
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Tabular data can be copied as tab delimited text and can be pasted into a spreadsheet program.
EpD
Ep<B_E_0_____~~~~~Map & location support
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~A new map widget (using libchamplain) was added to the UI.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Entries can now be assigned a location and a path.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~This will make writing writing about places and planning journeys easier and more fun.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~This can also be used to create charts of distances traveled per day.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Added support for geo tags.
EpD
Ep<B_E_0_____~~~~~Chart improvements
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Added a flexible mechanism to create charts for any quantifiable aspect of entries.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Charts can now be based on paragraphs based on dates entered in paragraphs. paragraph-focused
EfT76|93|3685621
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~All aspects of the charts can be edited through a single popover.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Any number of charts can be created within a diary and than embedded into entries by name.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Visual appeal of the charts improved greatly.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Added weekly mode (besides the existing monthly and yearly).
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Split cumulative mode into continuous and periodic sub types.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Added option to underlay the planned values under realized values.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Charts can now be dragged from the picker widget icon and dropped into entries.
EpD
Ep<B_E_0_____~~~~~More streamlined text search
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Text search is now a completely separate action from filtering.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Text search now lists the paragraphs rather than updating the entry list or disturbing the other parts of the UI in any way. distraction-free
EfT125|141|4687204
EpD
Ep<B_E_0_____~~~~~Filtering improvements
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Filters have their dedicated pane in the extra panel.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~A new, much more flexible filtering system that supports 2 levels of AND/OR filterers.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~The long requested feature delivered: Multiple tags can be filtered.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Different filter configurations can be created, named and added to the diary to be used later.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~It is now possible to filter by theme, completion and order as well.
EpD
Ep<B_E_0_____~~~~~Theme improvements
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Themes are now separate entities of their own (They used to be parts of tags).
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Introduced several stock themes in addition the the standard Lifeograph theme. New diaries will be created with them.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Entries can be filtered by themes.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Background images can now be set for themes. A handful of images bundled to the package for a more sensational writing experience.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Greatly improved preview system and editor for themes.
EpD
Ep<B_E_0_____~~~~~Completion percentages
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Lifeograph can now optionally calculate and display completion percentage for entries.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~This is not tied to the entry status and is controlled separately through values of a tag selected for this purpose by the user.
EpD
Ep<B_E_0_____~~~~~Printing improvements
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Added an option to use the theme colors in printouts (including the background color).
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~To-do items are printed much more nicely now.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Added an option to start entries in new pages.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Justify text option removed in favor of respecting the per paragraph justification settings.
EpD
Ep<B_E_0_____~~~~~Better support for keyboard only workflow
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Added new shortcuts to enable doing most of the tasks while typing without resorting to mouse.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~New IDE-like functionality to open new line below the current line.
EfT4|12|6460427
EpD
Ep<B_E_0_____~~~~~Bug fixes
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Adding tons of new features (possibly creating new bugs) did not stop us from fixing some longstanding bugs in text parsing, spellchecking, image handling, text alignment, and many others.
EpD
Ep<B_E_0_____~~~~~Miscellaneous improvements
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~A separate undo history is kept now for each entry and changing the current entry no longer clears the undo stack.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Added new keyboard shortcuts for various operations.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Clicking the column headers in diary file list in login view no longer changes the sorting. It can only be adjusted from the hamburger menu now. The rationale is that the column headers were rather prone to accidental clicks.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Clicking the back button right after logging in will log you out. This feels natural especially to Android users.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~The main icon updated to conform to the contemporary trends in graphics design.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Improvement the listing of differences in the synchronization dialog.
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Reduced the height of the headerbar to
Ep<_-E_1_____~~~~~Many under-the-hood improvements such as
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~A clearer db file structure.
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~Removal of big chunks of deprecated code and optimizations in many algorithms.
Ep<_-E_2_____~~~~~General infrastructural improvements in the code to have a better base for future developments.
